nira (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Windows builds are released: an installer that registers comic book
    file types, and a portable zip. Both are unsigned.
  * New: Close book command, resizable page sidebar, and an interface size
    that follows the display.
  * Fixes: opened books are stored under an absolute path, the sidebar
    resize strip stays off the scrollbar, and no console window opens on
    Windows.

 -- lokesh <lokdevp@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0530

nira (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Rebuilt as a Cargo workspace (nira-core + nira). Settings move to
    settings.toml and keys.toml; old preferences.conf and keybindings.conf
    are no longer read.

 -- lokesh <lokdevp@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0530

nira (0.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Rename the project to Nira. Settings, data and the thumbnail cache
    move to nira/ on first start.

 -- lokesh <lokdevp@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0530

